"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"x3GaXfpv0AUQhxb3aH5VgQ","review_id":"hMK_chTPwWrHAYfVaU8rHw","date":"2021-01-10T03:13:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9411069750785828,"text_excerpt":"Super friendly, LGBTQ place. I was a solo traveler for 5days and they welcomed me with open arms. Big shout out to Will, one of the bartenders there amazing person with such a big heart. Practically a local who recommended so many great things to do and places to see. A huge thanks to Andrew also, whom never met me before this trip but was able accommodate me for NYE when I called him a day before my trip. Super friendly staff. Amazing vibe. Keep killing it yall"},{"business_id":"x3GaXfpv0AUQhxb3aH5VgQ","review_id":"nowe0K2Dyuw4LRgXyRS5NA","date":"2016-01-15T00:01:34","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9371293783187866,"text_excerpt":"Always a good time. Jukebox,strong drinks, and most interesting crowd in New Orleans:) This place is 24 hours and the best time to go in is any time after 1am. I started going here because my favorite bar down the block shut down and has def played a sufficient role in being its replacement. One of the bartenders claims he is from another planet....love him!"},{"business_id":"x3GaXfpv0AUQhxb3aH5VgQ","review_id":"ZUwQpjSNMqPNNWseMsu8vQ","date":"2021-06-09T23:53:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9348921775817871,"text_excerpt":"Came here for my 21st and J.J. was uh-mazing!! He really made my boyfriend and I feel welcomed. It's more of a local bar but as tourist we felt a warm welcome. A steady crowd and several \"regulars\" it really made the place lively yet a very chill environment. J.J. Even played \"Happy Birthday\" for me! It was so good that we came back for our last night in NOLA. We will definitely be back."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"x3GaXfpv0AUQhxb3aH5VgQ","photo_id":"Uj72xmq8osQVspuqwZtBjw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Uj72xmq8osQVspuqwZtBjw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8637284636497498},